<title>UK: LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</title>
<headline>LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Reuter - Following are the buying and selling rates for leading world currencies and gold against the dollar on the London foreign exchange and bullion markets today.</p>
<p>US$1.00 COSTS    1.3744/49  Canadian Dollars</p>
<p>		     1.7922/32  German Marks</p>
<p>		     2.0183/93  Dutch Guilders</p>
<p>		     1.4780/90  Swiss Francs</p>
<p>		     37.02/03   Belgian Francs</p>
<p>		     6.0530/40  French Francs</p>
<p>		     1740.6/1.3 Italian Lire</p>
<p>		     116.00/10  Japanese Yen</p>
<p>		     7.8072/43  Swedish Crowns</p>
<p>		     7.4433/03  Norwegian Crowns</p>
<p>		     6.8327/51  Danish Crowns</p>
<p>One sterling     US$1.6770/80</p>
<p>Gold (ounce)     US$318.30/60</p>
</text>
